OL,3,GNEWSABridge stonework from police crash
OL,4,Ato stay in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighways officials have decided not to
OL,7,Frecover parts of a historic bridge
OL,8,Fwhich fell into the river after a
OL,9,Fpolice car crashed.
OL,11,FWorcester Bridge was damaged on 3 March
OL,12,Fafter a loose laptop lodged in the
OL,13,Fcar's steering column and the driver
OL,14,Flost control.
OL,16,FWorcestershire County Council has
OL,17,Fscheduled repairs for November, but
OL,18,Fsaid the missing stones were likely to
OL,19,Fbe damaged and would not pose a problem
OL,20,Fto river users.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
